间：11月24日（周二）19:00<br />📍 地点：dbaplus社群视频号</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYYOFdyJoFXcDyib0PibDEaw5Blb2tfqDA8ngRHlzYYR8aZo06X06jksbCggNicW1bc2ibblpvibeQ3FxaIF9wWQKxicoM9FUR52QJOt8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYY3se53xvwrsKym3PWaVTv9lJgu48DXMFErNxtsfzupOe5vibMCCPiakk2xKwSKZNUGXsUXibbWVibUrf2ESGKeh2CemS7GKEUmcaE%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYbXWXNalvUY5glrJ8yic0VnLpEjiajvUe4HRSnLTZianUJGLY5FxlQeBRnqL6ttqHbL14NAPc4FPr6xpz2NZUvGcAPJP2ry89o7eg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYYOFdyJoFXcDyib0PibDEaw5Blb2tfqDA8ngRHlzYYR8aZo06X06jksbCggNicW1bc2ibblpvibeQ3FxaIF9wWQKxicoM9FUR52QJOt8%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYY3se53xvwrsKym3PWaVTv9lJgu48DXMFErNxtsfzupOe5vibMCCPiakk2xKwSKZNUGXsUXibbWVibUrf2ESGKeh2CemS7GKEUmcaE%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-21T00:11:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkzMjYzNjkzNw%3D%3D:2247634621:1","title":"祝大家2026年：码足干劲，码上皆搞定！","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkzMjYzNjkzNw==&mid=2247634621&idx=1&sn=560d2885421ce0c2366b00a93d513c64&chksm=c32b467f20783520c3b2a86d0d52d0323ba4c73c99871f12bacfd17f5f2567d99ac1c25cd580&scene=126&sessionid=1795766448#rd","description":"做完你的做你的，我心里都有数！","content":"<p>做完你的做你的，我心里都有数！</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FgiamgWvCHDYahlRSoiankEY04rwKicAxh0Ficic1Y19BSDyvYh5eLJbaZQcB4QHHXEMPqia12Tt5TAsgdflBrbWFYCMGLQOA3C384MjVALwCWYnMg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mm